{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2013-02", "window": 2, "start_date": 1360281600, "end_date": 1360886399, "month_true_total": 31, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:47:18 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "2338190", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005957394", "personaname": "sarttan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sarttan/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 65, "playtime_forever": 822, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 774, "last_played": 1748213385, "avatar": "3ee14c72f1fd29fe217c7f24fc9fd1cada22b7c4"}, "language": "english", "review": "I know people like this game and I can respect their (wrong) opinions, but it feels like we are living the dreams of an inmature 12 year old kid.  (To any 12 year old kids reading this, I'm talking about the 12 year olds on Call Of Duty with XBox Live and mics.  THOSE people.  Please don't be THOSE people....(If you are one of THOSE people, you have my pitty and not much else.))  The combat is ok, but not great in my opinion.  I find the story completely unintresting.  The multiplayer I found to be a frustrating experience as well, but you might fare better than I did.\n\nIf there are 50000 reviews saying that this game is fun, and you greatly associate with the reviewers, then go on ahead and play.  Don't get me wrong.  It's not a bad game, it's just not my kind of game.", "timestamp_created": 1360818811, "timestamp_updated": 1385432691, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.468264579772949219", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "876859", "author": {"steamid": "76561197980804932", "personaname": "Lywelyn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://ste